UID:fathers-day-20270620@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270620
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270621
SUMMARY:Father's Day
DESCRIPTION:Father's Day falls on the third Sunday in June\, and it took mo
 re than sixty years to get there. Sonora Smart Dodd proposed it in Spokane
  in 1909\, after sitting through a Mother's Day sermon and thinking of her
  own father\, a Civil War veteran who had raised his children alone\; the 
 first service was held the following June. Congress did not give the day a
  standing annual designation until 1972\, which makes it one of the slowes
 t-moving holidays on the American calendar.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com
 /holiday/fathers-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/fathers-day/
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
