DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270705
SUMMARY:Independence Day
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:Independence Day marks July 4\, 1776\, the day the Second Conti
 nental Congress adopted the Declaration of Independence. It does not mark 
 the vote for independence\, which came two days earlier\, or the signing\,
  which mostly happened a month later. John Adams\, who was in the room\, e
 xpected Americans to celebrate July 2 forever.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.
 com/holiday/independence-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/independence-day/
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
