RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:St. Patrick's Day falls on March 17\, the traditional date of t
 he death of Ireland's patron saint\, and it is one of the few holidays Ame
 ricans largely built for themselves. The parades\, the green river in Chic
 ago\, the corned beef: almost all of it took shape in American cities\, am
 ong Irish immigrants who were not especially welcome in them.\n\nhttps://t
 odaycelebrates.com/holiday/st-patricks-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/st-patricks-day/
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
