UID:thanksgiving-day-20261126@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Day
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving falls on the fourth Thursday of November — Novem
 ber 26 in 2026 — and is a federal holiday. The story most people know\, 
 a 1621 feast at Plymouth\, rests on a single eyewitness letter that never 
 uses the word. The national holiday itself came later and more bureaucrati
 cally: presidential proclamations\, a magazine editor's years-long campaig
 n\, a Civil War\, and a 1941 argument over the Christmas shopping calendar
 .\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/thanksgiving-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/thanksgiving-day/
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
